{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11110070","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1111007001:1":{"text":"ウォルク！まさかお前に助けられる日が来るとはな！","source_cn":"瓦尔克，你这老狐狸！没想到我会有被你救的一天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB51512950557CDA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111007002:1":{"text":"そっちのババリアの青年は、お前の新しい相棒か？なかなか強そうじゃないか。","source_cn":"这蛮血少年是你的新搭档？不错啊，看起来身手不差。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC718144848CD0722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1111007002":{"text":"そっちのババリアの青年は、お前の新しい相棒か？なかなか強そうじゃないか。","source_cn":"这蛮血少年是你的新搭档？不错啊，看起来身手不差。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC718144848CD0722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111007003:1":{"text":"ああ、何かあった時に骨を拾ってくれる相棒が必要だろ？ウォルクみたいに一人で行動するバウンティハンターの方が珍しいんだ。","source_cn":"当然，赏金猎人常常结伴而行，要是出了意外，能有人收敛遗...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D3A37F3E9B3655B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ああ、何かあった時に骨を拾ってくれる相棒が必要だろ？ウォルクみたいに一人で行動するバウンティハンターの方が珍しいんだ。","female":"ああ、何かあった時に骨を拾ってくれる相棒が必要だろ？ウォルクみたいに一人で行動するバウンティハンターの方が珍しいんだ。","variant_male_record_index":"123164","variant_female_record_index":"123165","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111007004:1":{"text":"俺はもう、相棒はいらない。","source_cn":"我不会再找搭档了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":